        "number": 1,
        "text": "It is morning. Lily is at school. Teacher Kim comes to the class. \"Good morning, class!\" \"Good morning, Teacher Kim!\""
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "text": "\"Sit, please.\" The class sits. \"Open your books.\" \"Listen, please.\" Leo looks in his bag. \"Where is your pencil?\" asks Teacher Kim. \"No pencil!\" says Leo. \"Oh no!\""
      },
      {
        "number": 3,
        "text": "Lily has a pen. She has two pencils. \"Here you are, Leo.\" \"Thank you, Lily!\" Leo is happy. Teacher Kim looks at Lily. \"Good friends!\" she says. She shows a thumbs up. \"Stand, please.\" \"Goodbye, class!\""
      }
